# Unicode

Unicode character properties in pure LOGOS, driven by a compressed general-category range
table generated from the Unicode Character Database. Every codepoint's category is recovered by
binary search; `unicodedata.category` and the `go:unicode` category predicates build on it.
Auto-imported on first reference.

## Note
The flat general-category range table: `[start, end, categoryCode]` triples sorted by `start`.

It covers every assigned codepoint; `categoryCode` indexes the category list, and unassigned codepoints fall through to `Cn`.
